# Playwright Test Automation

Proyecto de automatización End-to-End usando **Playwright** y **JavaScript**.

## 🚀 Tecnologías

* Playwright
* Node.js
* JavaScript

## ▶️ Instalación

```bash
npm install
npx playwright install
```

## ▶️ Ejecutar tests

```bash
npx playwright test
```

## 📁 Estructura

* tests → casos de prueba
* playwright.config.js → configuración
